R”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE PRICING OF $1.4 BILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF SENIOR SECURED NOTES DUE FEBRUARY 15, 2024 (THE “NOTES”) WHICH WILL BEAR INTEREST AT AN ANNUAL RATE OF 0.972%. THE OFFERING OF THE NOTES IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE ON DECEMBER 17, 2020, SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS.'}{'symbol': 'MCHP', 'date': '2020-12-14 08:48:00', 'title': 'MICROCHIP TECHNOLOGY ANNOUNCES OFFERING OF SENIOR SECURED NOTES', 'text': 'CHANDLER, ARIZ., DEC. 14, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MICROCHIP TECHNOLOGY INCORPORATED (NASDAQ: MCHP) (“MICROCHIP,” “WE” OR “OUR”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS COMMENCED AN OFFERING OF $1.0 BILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF SENIOR SECURED NOTES (THE “NOTES”). MICROCHIP INTENDS TO USE THE NET PROCEEDS FROM THE OFFERING OF THE NOTES TO REPAY AMOUNTS OUTSTANDING UNDER ITS TERM LOANS UNDER ITS AMENDED AND RESTATED CREDIT AGREEMENT DATED AS OF MAY 29, 2018, AS AMENDED.'}{'symbol': 'MRNA', 'date': '2020-12-14 09:31:00', 'title': 'MODERNA CONFIRMS SUPPLY AGREEMENT WITH THE MINISTRY OF HEALTH TO SUPPLY SINGAPORE WITH MRNA VACCINE AGAINST COVID-19 (MRNA-1273)', 'text': 'CAMBRIDGE, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MODERNA CONFIRMS SUPPLY AGREEMENT WITH THE MINISTRY OF HEALTH TO SUPPLY SINGAPORE WITH MRNA VACCINE AGAINST COVID-19 (MRNA-1273).'}{'symbol': 'MSI', 'date': '2020-12-14 09:00:00', 'title': "PUBLIC SAFETY AGENCY SUCCESSFULLY TRIALS MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS' NEW CLOUD-BASED RADIO NETWORK CORE", 'text': 'CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FLORIDIANS ARE NO STRANGERS TO DRAMATIC WEATHER EVENTS SUCH AS HURRICANES OR FLOODS. FOR OVER 70 YEARS, MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS (NYSE:MSI) HAS WORKED WITH COUNTIES ACROSS THE STATE TO PROVIDE THEM WITH MISSION-CRITICAL COMMUNICATION SOLUTIONS TO HELP KEEP COMMUNITIES SAFE. THIS OCTOBER, SUMTER COUNTY COMPLETED A SUCCESSFUL TEST OF CIRRUSCENTRAL CORE, A CLOUD-BASED SECONDARY CORE FOR ASTRO® 25 PROJECT 25 (P25) LAND MOBILE RADIO (LMR) SYSTEMS, THAT ELIMINATES THE NEED FOR PUB'}{'symbol': 'NVR', 'date': '2020-12-14 15:35:00', 'title